    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0045_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "7ADAD6B0E91C4D9F",
      "text": "Nemona had mentioned there was a promising\\nnew face in the academy—yes, indeed.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0045_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "7ADAD5B0E91C4BEC",
      "text": "Oh, but I do apologize. I didn’t mean to startle\\nyou by addressing you so suddenly.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0045_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "7ADAD4B0E91C4A39",
      "text": "My name is Hassel. I’m one of the Elite Four of\\nthe Pokémon League.\\c\\nI also teach art classes at the academy.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0045_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "7ADAD3B0E91C4886",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]So, do tell me, young [VAR 0x0100(0000)]:\\nWhat\\r\\ncompels\\r\\nyou to\\r\\ncollect\\r\\nthese\\r\\nGym\\r\\nBadges\\r\\nand\\r\\nstrive\\r\\nto be a\\r\\nChampion?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
